repository-code: "https://github.com/DOKOS-TAYOS/querypact"
url: "https://github.com/DOKOS-TAYOS/querypact"
abstract: >-
  QueryPact verifies PostgreSQL SQL and migrations proposed by automated clients.
  It parses SQL, applies YAML policy, optionally runs controlled checks against
  operator-chosen aliases, redacts egress, and returns structured decisions or
  attestations without real row payloads in responses, strict logs, or attestation bodies.
keywords:
  - sql
  - postgresql
  - verification
  - ai-agents
  - mcp
  - security
  - policy
